<title>USA: Pharmaceutical Formulations says gets FDA approval.</title>
<headline>Pharmaceutical Formulations says gets FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>EDISON, N.J. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical Formulations Inc said Friday the Food and Drug Administration has approved its ANDA application to make and sell Naproxen Sodium.</p>
<p>The company said Naproxen Sodium is its generic version of Bayer's Aleve.</p>
<p>The company said intial shipments were booked in the recent quarter.</p>
